### ============================================================
### Side-Backend & Integration Tests
### Tests the full communication chain:
###   main-backend (8080) → side-backend (8081) → algorithm (in-memory)
### ============================================================

@sideBaseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@mainBaseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = your_access_token_here

### ============================================================
### PART 1: Direct side-backend tests (port 8081)
### ============================================================

### [1] Health check — side-backend should respond
GET {{sideBaseUrl}}/api/v1/algo/schedule

###

### [2] ✅ HAPPY PATH — Valid schedule request with 1 user and 1 task
### Expected: 200 OK with assignments list
POST {{sideBaseUrl}}/api/v1/algo/schedule
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "strategy": "GREEDY",
  "users": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "firstName": "Alice",
      "lastName": "Smith",
      "email": "alice@example.com",
      "dailyAvailabilityHours": 8,
      "maxTasks": 5,
      "roles": ["WORKER"],
      "vacations": []
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Build Login Page",
      "description": "Create the login UI",
      "durationHours": 4,
      "deadline": "2026-12-31T23:59:59",
      "priority": "HIGH",
      "priorityLevel": 3,
      "status": "PENDING",
      "requiredRoles": ["WORKER"],
      "predecessorTaskIds": [],
      "successorTaskIds": []
    }
  ]
}

###

